  <item>
    <title>vol.06：趁着双十一我们来聊聊品牌和代言人（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6716521b0d2f24f289c11a0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6716521b0d2f24f289c11a0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Oct 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见呀！代言人专题终于抬上来啦！前前后后聊了很多，聊完了之后转了一下文字应该是有三万多字（震惊.jpg）这是佳佳大刀阔斧之后的结果，这一期可能会相对比较枯燥一点点？下一期给大家聊点犀利一点点的（bushi）搞搞艺人商务以及带货能力大盘点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（ps：中间有提到一个品牌是“精选牧场”NEI不小心说成“新鲜牧场”这边先dbq一下~）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">00:02:43</a>关于“一个品牌代人”的诞生……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">00:08:50</a>做一次代言人营销常规的时间周期？不过安踏好像在做“极限挑战”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">00:10:56</a>你以为的品牌用心其实都是一种刻意的“粉丝运营”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">00:14:09</a>唯粉、CP粉、团粉……品牌做粉运真是不容易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">00:16:55</a>肖战影视剧联名，粉丝买账点在哪里……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">00:22:20</a>代言tittle大揭秘，有些tittle其实是品牌的一种试探……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">00:24:35</a>十个勤天近期商务现象浅谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">00:34:25</a>顺境找分众，逆境找李佳琦，绝境找肖战……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">00:40:42</a>不同品牌建设期的代言人策略会有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">00:41:41</a>新兴品牌的代言人策略（隅田川与肖战、成毅与探乐派……）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">00:46:09</a>成熟品牌的代言人策略（燕之屋与巩俐+王一博，小仙炖与章子怡+陈数+王俊凯）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3106">00:51:46</a>成熟品牌（拓量版）的代言人策略（心相印与肖战、立白与迪丽热巴、康师傅与杨紫、力士与王星越……）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">00:55:45</a>有些品牌签代言人跟不用钱一样……肖战、易烊千玺、杨紫、于适这啥策略啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3596">00:59:56</a>从广告媒介其实也能反推品牌代言人策略</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrQ90HEAJfntYDfzmjDk5jl_pVJh.m4a" length="61535511" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtlgVIIlwUwt24yEvyirkzI7t13r.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
