  <item>
    <title>vol.03：内娱怎么了！主播大肆吐槽内娱？你们要听的八卦来啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c2eea7db5e6d6bf958be89</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c2eea7db5e6d6bf958be89</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 07:05:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本想一本正经的聊一些严肃的话题，结果变成了吐槽局，有胡扯八扯的边角料以听个乐子为主～</span></p><span></span><p><span>_____________</span></p><span></span><p><span>搭配时间线食用更方便哟~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">00:02:07</a>从世界是不是一个“草台班子”说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a>“世界是一个草台班子”其实是一种自我松绑宣泄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">00:09:12</a> 有你这样的人做业内就很扯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">00:11:14</a>在挑选艺人是老板经常会说的一句话“体感不火”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="837">00:13:57</a>“空降剧”成风到底是策略还是硬扯……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">00:19:18</a>业内押宝的《狐妖小红娘》到底怎么了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">00:22:07</a>到底谁在看好《长相思》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">00:23:42</a>朱一龙粉丝路演尴尬大事件浅分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">00:30:41</a>和0713男团艺人对接时发生的抓马事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">00:35:28</a>哈哈哈到底谁在片场拿走我的外卖啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2426">00:40:26</a>内娱的酒桌文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2908">00:48:28</a>内娱啊内娱你到底怎么了！我们又该怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3361">00:56:01</a>等待内娱杀回来的一天……</span></p><span></span><p><span>_____________</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢收听~大家友爱讨论哟！我们先滑跪啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>找到我们-微博@内娱怎么了</span></p>]]></description>
