    <itunes:duration>00:57:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtlgVIIlwUwt24yEvyirkzI7t13r.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.02：十个勤天粉丝诉求被满足？舆论场该如何获取最大路人缘？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b6daecdb5e6d6bf93bdcab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b6daecdb5e6d6bf93bdcab</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Aug 2024 03:13:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>粉丝被资本忽悠了？？从内容制作角度来分析《种地吧》的纷争，以传播学角度拆解粉丝舆论场。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuL4tjuaZ0IXLSpsGz-Y3yVWcvTQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期我们将接着上一期的话题，继续聊聊关于《种地吧》和十个勤天的那些事~当我们将“赶人事件”“粉丝诉求”等等现象置于整个当下的娱乐环境和舆论场中，发酵的成因错综复杂……感觉聊也聊不完，大刀阔斧之下终于也把这期抬上来啦！撒fafa！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>NEI个就是说搭配时间线食用效果更佳噢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">00:01:42</a>在去除《种地吧》流量支撑之后，十个勤天是否有足以支撑各自稳定发展的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">00:04:14</a>“追梦”与《种地吧》变成二选一的抉择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">00:05:25</a>结合影视综制作经验畅谈十人后续发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">00:09:26</a>《种地吧》“赶人事件”大盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">00:10:41</a>本来可以“零元购”……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">00:13:07</a>《种地吧》IP是初心，十个勤天是意外？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">00:24:02</a>《种地吧》第三季小畅想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">00:25:36</a>粉丝为什么对换人、加人事件情绪上头？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">00:30:53</a>节目组好像在玩一种文字游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">00:37:06</a>粉丝的诉求是什么？可能达到吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">00:39:15</a>舆论场纷争之下会有真正的赢家吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">00:51:45</a>和“资本”刚到底的两种类型，两个典型：陈楚生、肖战……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3684">01:01:24</a>十个勤天属于“弱传播”的一方……</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>两枚播客小白还在不断踩坑、试错、探索中……</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家有什么意见建议欢迎随时po给我们！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>找我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>官方微博/抖音：@内娱怎么了</span></p><span></span><p><span>NEINEI微博/小红书：@陈圈圈呐</span></p>]]></description>
